  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\n## [0.4.0] - 2026-06-02\n\n### 🚀 Features\n\n- *(mcp)* Add mcp\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- *(mcp)* Improve pagination, search API, and tool naming\n\n### 💼 Other\n\n- *(cli)* Use ResolveBatchAsync instead of sequential ResolveAsync in DependentList\n\n### 🚜 Refactor\n\n- *(cli)* Extract business logic to Operations, add MCP tools with explicit naming, add JsonStringEnumConverter\n\n### ⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks\n\n- Update packages\n\n<!-- generated by git-cliff -->",
